        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The troop excels at surprise attacks. If the troop acts before all enemies in the first round of combat, it gains a +2 status bonus to its Battle DC for its first Battle or Salvo attack that round. The troop can attempt a Stealth check for initiative.</p>"
